 ## Subtopics
+
+### [Textured Mesh Refinement](15515-textured-mesh-refinement.md)
+Renders a geometric mesh approximation and refines the image with a neural network to recover missing details and correct shading errors. It differs from voxel-based methods by using projective texturing for UV maps, though it shares limitations regarding GAN artifacts and shadow estimation. Choose it when mesh-based rendering is preferred over voxel grids.
